Welcome to Orion Linux!

This is a development preview. Things will break. Have fun.

- To install Orion Linux to disk, run:  orion-installer
- To see what's installed:               orion-pkg list
- To search for a package:               orion-pkg search <name>
- To read the docs:                      less /usr/share/doc/orion/

